{
  "fragmentCount": 19,
  "fragments": [
    {
      "contentSha256": "9a9ed9d4d76db3ee6ddb8cd2e22328603932190b3716d03d3a90f260b854c628",
      "contentText": "**第一条** 为明确 DEMO-BANK 流动资金贷款业务的风险识别、计量与控制要求，制定本指引。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN005-0001",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 1,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN005-20260922-81362bf8"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "6110f90dbb9c4c8e59e21cc9b35b97425f6d006fd2eb0037a4c268c671b5b634",
      "contentText": "**第二条** 本指引所称风险包括：信用风险、用途与合规风险、操作风险、集中度风险与声誉风险。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN005-0002",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 2,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN005-20260922-81362bf8"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "d7a4724ede4513d1b333b2de47b656d9b66a5607ae52a4af6725d61a9767bbce",
      "contentText": "**第三条** 风险管理应贯穿贷前调查、贷中审查、发放支付与贷后管理全过程，并与客户统一授信管理衔接。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN005-0003",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 3,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN005-20260922-81362bf8"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "84cd0469c609c01e0e8e686cf6d7893d775e2a4ce3e99f723310a861bb413933",
      "contentText": "**第四条** 贷前应重点识别：一、借款人营运资金需求的真实性与测算合理性；二、借款用途的真实交易背景；三、关联交易与股权结构风险；四、借款人所在行业景气与周期位置。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN005-0004",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 4,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN005-20260922-81362bf8"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "086cb9fe82e355f5505282e7156c5c7e869e0eb4bc8a12df8c3cf1f2a92c0c4d",
      "contentText": "**第五条** 不得以降低信贷条件或超过借款人实际资金需求的方式发放贷款。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN005-0005",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 5,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN005-20260922-81362bf8"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "42ea5e2fc1ba63b0eacbcd0794f5fa69fc6bd653e681bc320d098ea267ad7a02",
      "contentText": "**第六条** 发现借款人与交易对象存在**虚构贸易背景**嫌疑的，应中止受理并留存核查记录。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN005-0006",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 6,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN005-20260922-81362bf8"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "2d1e6e6e4e6bd9f8815116f3f2d9f795eb339704737996b0a3b078276bb7d38d",
      "contentText": "**第七条** 资金挪用防范措施至少包括：账户监控、支付对象与凭证核验、回款账户约定、异常支付预警。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN005-0007",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 7,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN005-20260922-81362bf8"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "7b40820f2d7f430d3b6566763c7614b8edcf49669b7fd3f1b83daa68bd44a06c",
      "contentText": "**第八条** 出现下列情形之一应触发用途核查：一、单笔支付金额与合同约定明显不符；二、资金在短期内多次回流借款人关联账户；三、支付对象与商务合同交易对象不一致。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN005-0008",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 8,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN005-20260922-81362bf8"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "0a4c6e14a58df9f34bc536e64528a9880fd7d1f96df94cff91d223f056d9f922",
      "contentText": "**第九条** 经核查确认挪用的，应当采取以下措施之一或并用：要求限期整改、提前收回贷款、调整支付方式、下调贷款风险分类，并按合同约定追究违约责任。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN005-0009",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 9,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN005-20260922-81362bf8"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "225f9fadf8319d2a8f43429272ff00ac690b28773f6d058676eeaa17b71300da",
      "contentText": "**第十条** 贷后应建立\"定期 + 触发式\"检查机制：正常客户每季度至少一次非现场监测，出现预警信号的应在十五个工作日内开展现场检查。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN005-0010",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 10,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN005-20260922-81362bf8"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "ba43e0745d61fa05af244e587324ad4e73b5a8534fe456c1718be28615752255",
      "contentText": "**第十一条** 预警信号包括：借款人经营或财务明显趋差、信用状况下降、担保物价值显著下降、法定代表人或者实际控制人发生重大不利变化、发生重大交叉违约。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN005-0011",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 11,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN005-20260922-81362bf8"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "b321486d31ffa7b668ed189fd7b753a97eb5fceaaac23d2fcfc7cab6362cdee6",
      "contentText": "**第十二条** 预警信号处置流程为：信号识别 → 风险等级初判 → 处置方案制定 → 执行与复核 → 记录归档。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN005-0012",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 12,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN005-20260922-81362bf8"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "53cc065e421a7a2e578f14e60016663a65ead8f25005d1c0dfd0f59fa19f3dea",
      "contentText": "**第十三条** 对风险分类为次级及以下的贷款，应制定专项清收或重组方案。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN005-0013",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 13,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN005-20260922-81362bf8"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "7e364557d974458ca87c79c8a8d0394f3b9b594af74faf07ad4be948c77104a8",
      "contentText": "**第十四条** 应关注流动资金贷款的行业集中度与单一集团客户集中度；超出本行限额管理要求的，须报上级行审批并说明缓释安排。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN005-0014",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 14,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN005-20260922-81362bf8"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "897c5af24ab473351a7e9e0603a673c33e5069d024075dd3702cad26414c2f56",
      "contentText": "**第十五条** 风险管理责任落实：客户经理负责信息收集与预警初判，审查人员负责独立核验与风险评价，审批人员负责授权范围内决策，贷后管理人员负责监控与处置执行。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN005-0015",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 15,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN005-20260922-81362bf8"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "f2f6ffe09d86f8e260308cf288892f5a3b7a74bca5679bd459bd814bd3d898dd",
      "contentText": "**第十六条** 未按本指引履职的，按内部问责规定处理。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN005-0016",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 16,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN005-20260922-81362bf8"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "7c4a5e27208c587f92a024da5abd95cd743ec973642cd6c1da6d3091e9fa832d",
      "contentText": "**第十七条** 本指引与本办法之外的具体产品制度不一致的，按\"从严从高\"原则执行。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN005-0017",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 17,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN005-20260922-81362bf8"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "308eae71ddbd56baa1f1ceb364a007dca9d248dfabfd932e0aaf90d1660f2bfd",
      "contentText": "**第十八条** 本指引由 DEMO-BANK 风险管理部负责解释与修订。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN005-0018",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 18,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN005-20260922-81362bf8"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "387acd02994799faf745df1a313c3c451b50c17851eefadb5869244258795960",
      "contentText": "**第十九条** 本指引自发布之日起施行。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN005-0019",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 19,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN005-20260922-81362bf8"
    }
  ],
